    "primary_rationale": "180 days was inherited from EODMAE, whose episode ends at first paid activation. Here the median time to a first PA is 61 days and to a first payout 141 days, so a 180-day horizon ends at roughly the first withdrawal and the reinvestment loop being studied barely runs. Lengthening the horizon flips the sign of net realized cash.",
